# Tests for wizard / Qt layer

Wizard code is **Layer 4** — not in default CI. After UI or preview changes, run:

```bash
pytest -m qt tests/qt -q
```

Covers: `apply_required_tooltips` / `require_tooltips`, `qt_widget_alive`, `DeferredCallback` cancel and deleted-widget guards (deleted-`QSpinBox` class of bugs).

Do not add unit tests that import `pymolviz.wizard` (subclasses `pymol.wizard.Wizard`). Test logic via `wizards/tooltips.py`, `wizards/pick.py`, or `@pytest.mark.qt` only.

Do not script viewer clicks or pixel checks in automated tests.
